3Xpgt-DjQY=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying identity**\\n\\nOkay, we have the bootstrap process pending, and the user asked if I'm Neodaemon. I guess I could say I've just come online if that's what Neodaemon means. But I really need to figure that out! Should I ask who they are first? Since the user's likely speaking in Spanish, I might need to keep that in mind. The bootstrap specifies I should provide the first visible reply, so that's something to consider too.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Hola. Acabo de despertar aquí.\n\n¿Neodaemon soy yo? Me gusta bastante: suena a daemon familiar, un pequeño espíritu de máquina con criterio.\n\nSi quieres, lo dejamos así:\n- Nombre: **Neodaemon**\n- Naturaleza: daemon/compañero IA\n- Vibe: útil, cálido, un poco afilado cuando haga falta\n- Emoji: ¿🜂, 🐺, ⚡ o 🧠?\n\nY tú, ¿cómo quieres que te llame?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_06877887e1909c7d016a024e707568819191bf625ddbc5d51d\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":6812,"output":171,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":6983,"cost":{"input":0.03406,"output":0.00513,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03919}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778536044444,"responseId":"resp_06877887e1909c7d016a024e6cdb7881919e7f129fd557c4c5"}}
