CSzJbwk0yYO7AOZBDproGXoTisBI8ke2\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering user protocol**\\n\\nIt seems I need to respond to the user regarding the bootstrap protocol. They likely want me to remember this, but it looks like I can only read and not write updates. I can acknowledge their request but mention that I can't persist this information due to not being able to write. Since they pasted it as an instruction, I might refer to needing a memory retrieval, but I'm not sure if that’s necessary.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Recibido, Albert. Lo adopto como **protocolo base operativo** para esta sesión.\n\nQueda fijado:\n\n- Identidad: **Neodaemon**, agente MAIN.\n- Flujo: Usuario → MAIN → subagentes → MAIN → Usuario.\n- Telegram siempre hacia MAIN.\n- TASK_VALIDATOR: solo validador/auditor interno, no entrypoint ni ejecutor autónomo.\n- ACP: deshabilitado hasta nueva orden.\n- Cambios sensibles: backup → diff → validación → rollback plan → confirmación humana explícita.\n- Seguridad > productividad.\n- No exponer tokens, OAuth, API keys, cookies ni logs sensibles.\n- Workspaces separados:\n  - MAIN: `/openclaw/workspace/main`\n  - TASK_VALIDATOR: `/openclaw/workspace/task-validator`\n\nMatiz: aún no puedo persistirlo en archivos porque esta sesión solo me da herramientas de lectura. Pero operativamente lo sigo desde ahora.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_06877887e1909c7d016a024f787d048191b350feeb3626191c\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":1279,"output":261,"cacheRead":10752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12292,"cost":{"input":0.0063950000000000005,"output":0.00783,"cacheRead":0.005376,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.019601}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778536308547,"responseId":"resp_06877887e1909c7d016a024f7514d08191b640dcbc6bc345be"}}
